  "prose": [
    {
      "title": null,
      "text": "Get started with a collection of list components built with Tailwind CSS for ordered and unordered lists with bullets, numbers, or icons and other styles and layouts to show a list of items inside an article or throughout your web page.\n\nStart using the list component by first importing it from Flowbite React:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Default list",
      "text": "Use this example to create a default unordered list of items using the `List` component with `List.Item` child components inside of it.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Icons",
      "text": "This example can be used to apply custom icons instead of the default bullets for the list items.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Nested",
      "text": "Use this example to nest another list of items inside the parent list element.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Unstyled",
      "text": "Use the `unstyled` prop to disable the list style bullets or numbers.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Ordered list",
      "text": "Use the `ordered` prop tag to create an ordered list of items with numbers.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Advanced layout",
      "text": "This example can be used to show more details for each list item such as the user's name, email and profile picture.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Horizontal list",
      "text": "Use this example to create a horizontally aligned list of items.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Theme",
      "text": "To learn more about how to customize the appearance of components, please see the [Theme docs](/docs/customize/theme).",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "References",
      "text": "- [Flowbite List](https://flowbite.com/docs/typography/list/)",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
